{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2022-04-06 09:00:00', 'title': 'JOHN LAWLER TO DISCUSS ACCELERATION OF THE FORD+ PLAN AT BANK OF AMERICA GLOBAL AUTOMOTIVE SUMMIT', 'text': "DEARBORN, MICH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FORD CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, JOHN LAWLER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AND DISCUSS ACCELERATING THE FORD+ PLAN AT BANK OF AMERICA'S 2022 GLOBAL AUTOMOTIVE SUMMIT WITH AUTO ANALYSTS JOHN MURPHY AND DOUG KARSON. THE CONFERENCE WILL TAKE PLACE ON APRIL 13, AT 10:35 A.M. ET. LAWLER WILL EXPLAIN HOW THE RECENT ORGANIZATIONAL ANNOUNCEMENT WILL HELP FORD TO REVOLUTIONIZE THE AUTO OWNERSHIP EXPERIENCE FOR CUSTOMERS WHILE DELIVERING FUTURE GROWTH FOR THE COMPANY"}